Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:12.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:17.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I've always felt as though there is someone beyond the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.62,0:00:27.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But, there's not the slightest chance of anyone being there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:33.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wake up, and I regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:36.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I regret looking for that someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:39.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.19,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Dear Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.19,0:00:51.44,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,It's your week's allowance and lunch money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.87,0:01:01.16,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Ah, right. It's time you go to school, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.16,0:01:03.71,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I just got back... from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.75,0:01:07.08,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Did you pick up the money I left you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:14.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There is nowhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.63,0:01:18.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...where I belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.89,0:01:28.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But for no real reason... I did go to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.78,0:01:35.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,One of those force of habit things.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.91,0:01:45.29,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's really beautiful.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.29,0:01:46.87,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,My heart is dancing.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's only now.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.34,0:01:55.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,In less then a week,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.22,0:01:58.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,they'll all fall to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.97,0:02:03.56,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:06.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,...they'll bloom again next year.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.56,0:02:13.19,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,They will bloom beautifully the year after that, and the year after that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.46,0:02:30.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:34.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The bell rang a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:39.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:44.76,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um, if you don't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:48.52,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,...will you walk up this hill together?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.56,0:02:53.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Walk up the hill together?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.27,0:02:54.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:58.07,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I can make it this far every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.49,0:03:03.16,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But no matter what, I can't walk up the rest of the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:07.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's strange, isn't it? But I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:13.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Then... Then can I follow you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:17.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll just follow your back up the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:19.63,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Is that fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:25.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I didn't answer her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.31,0:03:30.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who walks behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.14,0:03:34.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I just walk wherever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:39.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.57,0:03:42.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But... Now that I think back...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:47.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That was when I first met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:51.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It was when everything began.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:58.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm Furukawa Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.75,0:03:59.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:04.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why does it matter? You just followed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:09.77,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I would want to know your name in case I see you next time and want to say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:11.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We won't see each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.93,0:04:13.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Even if we do, just act like you don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:16.77,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm Furukawa Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:18.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I heard that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.61,0:04:20.94,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:24.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm Okazaki Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:26.74,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okazaki Tomoya-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:30.66,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:36.04,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I was able to walk up the hill\Nand make it all the way to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.21,0:04:46.34,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Hey, Okazaki, if you're that bored,\Nwake up Sunohara sitting next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.89,0:04:50.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just so you know, he's not the best at waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:52.31,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,I told you to wake him up, so wake him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:55.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, Sunohara, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.53,0:05:06.03,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Sunohara!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.49,0:05:07.53,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Don't bite my ear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:10.08,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Stop... Stop licking...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:18.58,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki, what are you going to have for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:19.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:22.05,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Bread, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.63,0:05:26.84,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yeah, the cafeteria's stuffed bread is pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:27.93,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,But it's really crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:28.80,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Fried noodle bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:29.97,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Ham cutlet bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:30.72,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Ginger roast bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:33.31,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,So all the stuffed bread will be sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.23,0:05:37.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll pay for you, so go buy some.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:38.60,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.65,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:42.36,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'll get myself moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.99,0:05:46.07,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You wanna die or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:47.99,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We're all in line, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.16,0:05:52.12,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.83,0:05:55.66,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Never give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:59.46,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Sunohara Youhei, swimming all the way to the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:01.54,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,The gold medal he always dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:02.84,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,The prize is stuffed bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:04.13,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Go for it, Sunohara!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.13,0:06:05.42,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Sunohara, you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:11.43,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I told you not to cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:29.66,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:32.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okazaki Tomoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.53,0:06:35.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,This is a nice place, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:39.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The wind is nice, too, and it's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:41.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, since it's off limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:45.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,When the lifestyle guidance staff finds you, you'll get yelled at.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:49.38,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll say I'm sorry when that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.31,0:06:55.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you come here often?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:57.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:06:58.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Only from time to time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:01.56,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Today's the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.56,0:07:07.03,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It was my first time at school in a while, so I was wondering what I should do during the lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:11.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Usually you spend it eating lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:12.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Unless, you've already eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:14.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sweet bean bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:17.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm about to buy sweet bean bread and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:21.04,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The sweet bean bread at the cafeteria is really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:23.71,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's crowded down there now because of the stuffed breads,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.71,0:07:27.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,but the sweet bean bread usually has leftovers, even though they're really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:29.76,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,So I go, buy them, and eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.97,0:07:40.39,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:42.14,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I made you wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:43.06,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.06,0:07:44.19,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I apologize...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:47.19,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,The food stand was crowded like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.19,0:07:51.36,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Even with my best efforts,\NI could only buy sweet bean bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:55.41,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,And that pissed me off, so I used the entire ¥1000.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You know I don't eat sweet bean bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:08:00.75,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,But given the situation, please, eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.26,0:08:11.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:12.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sweet bean bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.01,0:08:14.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You haven't had lunch yet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:16.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:19.06,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, Okazaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:20.98,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I said wait! Tomoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:40.08,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Right. The Founders Festival's coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:42.71,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,All the clubs are working hard with preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:47.38,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Compared to that, we aren't in any clubs, so we have it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.67,0:08:54.76,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,So Okazaki, who was that girl on the roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:56.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.18,0:08:58.55,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You're going to play dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:01.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's Furukawa Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:02.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't know anything more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.64,0:09:05.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That's enough to say you know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.27,0:09:12.53,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,But I don't recall seeing her on campus before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:20.66,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,It's intolerable how students are oblivious to the problems this school is facing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:26.33,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,The student council must be clear on these problems and state them to the school!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.79,0:09:30.80,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,That is the reason why I am announcing my bid for student council president!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:33.63,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Sakagami Tomoyo! Sakagami Tomoyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:38.80,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I strongly believe that Tomoyo is the most suited to being the student body representative.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:41.72,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Vote for Sakagami Tomoyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:46.06,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,A double event with the Founders Festival\Nand student council presidential election, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:48.40,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It'll be hectic for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:51.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Pay back my ¥1000.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:52.15,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:55.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You wasted it, so pay me back in full.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:57.95,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Let me think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:09:59.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You'd {\i1}better{\i0\fscx53.333} {\r} think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.95,0:10:06.12,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,But really, she was a cute girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:11.92,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Just think of the ¥1000 as an investment in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.55,0:10:13.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Like I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:24.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm having the dream again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.56,0:10:28.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The dream of wandering about, searching for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:34.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then, I finally realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:40.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm just the mind and don't have a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.24,0:10:48.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's why that someone didn't notice me, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.92,0:10:53.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So first, I started to look for my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.96,0:10:58.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I looked for it in a hurry and in panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:04.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And I finally found a container for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:23.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Even then, I didn't think I'd meet the person anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:27.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There was no sign the person, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.29,0:11:36.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Beyond my eyes were endless plains that stretched to the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:42.68,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Tomoya. Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:47.26,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I was able to come home a little earlier than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.89,0:11:49.52,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Should I toast some bread for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:52.23,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,You should eat something before you go to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.65,0:11:55.36,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.73,0:11:57.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't need any.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:11:59.07,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:12.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,My mother died when I was five.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.17,0:12:16.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I've been raised by my father ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:24.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sure it was hard for him to work\Nand take care of me at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.30,0:12:26.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I understand that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:28.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:36.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I started having that dream that freezes\Nmy heart before I started elementary school,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:41.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,and unknowingly, I started not to speak with my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:47.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,On top of that, the fatal accident took place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:57.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,{\fscx97.185}It was autumn of my 3rd year of junior high, when admission to a high school through a sports scholarship looked promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.63,0:13:03.63,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:06.34,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I'm home, Tomoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.93,0:13:10.31,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Dad's back with a gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:15.10,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Come on, eat up. It's the supreme sushi set.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:16.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.56,0:13:17.44,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.86,0:13:20.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And you smell sick of alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:22.99,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Here, just eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.36,0:13:25.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I said I don't need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.16,0:13:30.03,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:39.25,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Tomoya? Tomoya-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.34,0:13:50.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The shoulder tendon is ripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:53.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The doctor diagnosed it as such...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:56.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...and my basketball life ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.66,0:14:18.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:20.33,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Like I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.33,0:14:21.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.88,0:14:24.38,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Like I said, I wanted to ask for a favor from you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:26.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"Favor" you say...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:29.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please let me walk up the hill behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:35.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We're late again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:36.77,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.43,0:14:40.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If all you need is a back to follow up,\Nthere are plenty of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:41.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just ask other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.52,0:14:45.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you waited for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.65,0:14:46.94,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.44,0:14:48.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.95,0:14:53.03,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okazaki Tomoya-san. I got to know the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.45,0:14:55.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's a very ill-intentioned ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.66,0:14:57.41,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, I was ambushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:08.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The hill's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:10.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why can't you walk this up alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.18,0:15:12.47,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,There's nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.43,0:15:14.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.43,0:15:19.60,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Even if I went to school, I don't know what I should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:24.40,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,There is nothing fun...\Nnor is there a reason I have to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.15,0:15:28.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I can't go to a place where I know there's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:32.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I get worried, my legs stop moving, and I shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:36.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You said you liked the sweet bean bread there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.20,0:15:38.16,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:40.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then walk up the hill to eat the sweet bean bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:45.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, I guess... But sweet bean bread isn't enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:47.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then find something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:50.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Find something you need to do at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.30,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.14,0:15:54.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Find that, and then no more ambushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.10,0:15:57.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:04.81,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Furukawa Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:10.69,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,She's a senior like us, but she's probably a year or two older than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:18.20,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,She was sick all last year,\Nso she's repeating her senior year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.91,0:16:21.50,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,No wonder we've never seen her around before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:25.71,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,If you have anything else you want to know, say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:28.59,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,My information network comes in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:31.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:32.76,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,¥500.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:33.88,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,No IOUs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:35.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I never asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.84,0:16:38.81,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Your face says you want to know more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:39.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.72,0:16:42.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sunohara Youhei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.81,0:16:45.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Former star midfielder of the soccer team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:49.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Right now, he got booted from the club and is just a punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:54.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He got in as a sports recruit,\Nbut he snapped in the middle of a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:19.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I didn't hear what the exact reason was,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.93,0:17:22.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,but he broke another player's teeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:23.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,bit off an ear,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.56,0:17:28.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,and he kicked his coach's most important appendage with full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.16,0:17:45.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,{\fscx99.556}He's usually a carefree guy, but he got labeled a monster when he snaps, and now I'm the only one he talks to at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:47.92,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,No stars out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.96,0:17:55.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,By the way, unlike me, he's got guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:04.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I mean, even after he got booted from the team, he's still living in the dorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:08.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,In the dorm where only sports recruited students can live.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.85,0:18:15.53,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Well, what can I do?! My family's poor,\Nso I can't find a new apartment now and pay rent!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.15,0:18:20.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He brags how he's managed through\Nthe school's multiple attempts to get him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.33,0:18:26.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I want some ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:30.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You bought a big size one, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.71,0:18:34.13,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,No! This is my breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:34.76,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You can't have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.09,0:18:42.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Windy weather lasted for a few days after a rain...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.26,0:18:46.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...and that ended the sakura for the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:50.77,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:53.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey. Haven't seen you in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.94,0:18:55.98,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.20,0:19:02.12,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I had a little fever and was absent from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:03.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:04.45,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:13.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But look. I'm better now and am walking up the hill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.63,0:19:16.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's natural to walk up alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:17.46,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:22.80,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-san, I found something at school that I look forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.01,0:19:27.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I've thought about it, and I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.27,0:19:30.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.14,0:19:30.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.65,0:19:34.44,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:36.19,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's all due to your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.19,0:19:38.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.66,0:19:46.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:48.12,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:14.77,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:21.24,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:25.12,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.12,0:20:27.28,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I was able to buy stuffed bread today!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.95,0:20:31.00,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Look, dumpling sandwich and fried noodle bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:36.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.00,0:20:38.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.75,0:20:39.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:46.01,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Furukawa, if stuffed bread is all right, come stuff yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.01,0:20:47.47,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.39,0:20:51.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tatata, tada!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.85,0:20:54.73,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.48,0:20:57.69,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Recruiting members?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:20:58.90,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,The Theater Club?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.11,0:21:01.40,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm recruiting members.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.65,0:21:06.11,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I will reestablish the Theater Club that closed down last year because all the members left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.49,0:21:10.08,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm making a poster for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.91,0:21:12.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Theater Club, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.91,0:21:16.63,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This... This drawing looks like a marshmallow, if not an egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:17.38,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:19.38,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's the Big Dango Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.38,0:21:23.01,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's the Big Dango Family that was popular when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.01,0:21:24.93,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I drew them since I love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:29.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dango, dango, dango, dango.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.39,0:21:33.31,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dango family is a big family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.31,0:21:40.02,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Always a happy big family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:43.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The house is always like a sports day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.11,0:21:47.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Ready go, run run run. Family marathon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:51.83,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Time for a bath. Get inside. Breath-holding competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.83,0:21:56.67,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dango. Dango's a big family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.08,0:22:01.13,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I remember that song back when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.67,0:22:05.38,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The boom still lives within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.38,0:22:09.09,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The big family where everyone cares about each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.34,0:22:10.47,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I love them so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.05,0:22:16.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So, this Theater Club is what you mentioned earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.23,0:22:20.19,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. It's the fun I found at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.73,0:22:22.77,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I will reestablish the Theater Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.77,0:22:26.70,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I will perform a play at the Founders Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.45,0:22:31.41,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I think I'll be able to walk up\Nthe hill every day if I have this goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.74,0:22:38.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll make lots of posters\Nand post them everywhere around the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.62,0:22:44.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dango, dango, dango, dango.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:48.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dango family is a big family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:55.22,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Always a happy big family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.63,0:22:55.60,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,She was singing so cheerfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.81,0:23:04.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What was that bright light I saw eight years ago on the rooftop about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.82,0:23:09.11,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Saito Electrical Construction, Ltd.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.40,0:23:09.24,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Hey, Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.91,0:23:13.62,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.95,0:23:15.08,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You'll catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.00,0:23:21.63,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Come back to work already.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.04,0:23:26.05,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,It might help you getting over things if you work up a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.05,0:23:28.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Yoshino-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.72,0:23:31.47,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You're not being treated as absent without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.05,0:23:35.43,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I'm telling the president that you call in every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.18,0:23:37.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.89,0:23:38.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll need some more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.68,0:23:42.35,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I see. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.06,0:23:44.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.15,0:23:46.82,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Everyone's worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.49,0:23:50.57,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,They're all thinking that you're depressed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.95,0:23:57.16,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,They're all waiting to hear from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.74,0:23:59.79,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Everyone's thinking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.66,0:24:01.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.21,0:24:04.04,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Nagisa-chan often said,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.63,0:24:07.67,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,"Big families always think about each other."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.42,0:24:09.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.17,0:24:11.13,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Okazaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.09,0:24:15.39,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Okazaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.95,0:24:35.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.32,0:24:37.08,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.33,0:24:38.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What? To where?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.04,0:24:39.95,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Just come!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.71,0:24:47.34,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That! Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.47,0:24:55.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Void?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.59,0:24:56.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What do you mean void?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.85,0:24:59.72,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Void means void. It means invalid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.35,0:25:03.31,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Member recruitment for clubs was only allowed until last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.31,0:25:07.19,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Therefore member recruiting outside of the timeframe is against the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.86,0:25:09.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sakagami.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.52,0:25:14.28,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,This forceful act had to have been done by the current student council's executives.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.28,0:25:16.11,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,They're eggheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.49,0:25:17.57,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Sakagami!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.57,0:25:21.66,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Wh-Where are these executives?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.08,0:25:22.95,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.83,0:25:26.12,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This poster is handmade, you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.12,0:25:29.63,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's a message from the heart,\Ndrawn with heart and passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.42,0:25:31.76,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Damn this cross!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.09,0:25:36.63,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Guys are strolling around campus looking for these posters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.63,0:25:39.22,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,So they can put the cross on or rip them off walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.81,0:25:44.10,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.36,0:25:50.19,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Sunohara!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.65,0:25:51.86,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Don't snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.86,0:25:53.82,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,If you do, you'll get expelled this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.28,0:25:57.32,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Let's go check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.32,0:25:57.91,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.91,0:25:58.82,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,He's seriously snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.82,0:25:59.95,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,This is interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.87,0:26:02.45,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.46,0:26:12.71,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,They got this one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.55,0:26:21.05,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Crap, even here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.85,0:26:22.89,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.81,0:26:29.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Furukawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.77,0:26:32.40,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.15,0:26:34.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Meet me on the roof after school!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.28,0:26:35.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.65,0:26:38.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Wait for me on the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.70,0:26:40.49,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.12,0:26:49.17,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.67,0:26:51.75,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.35,0:27:07.31,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,It's started!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.56,0:27:09.35,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,They're over at the old school building.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.56,0:27:11.69,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I heard blood is all over the place already.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.69,0:27:12.61,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.61,0:27:14.32,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,This way! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.69,0:27:16.61,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.07,0:27:21.53,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What are {\i1}you{\i0\fscx53.333} {\r} guys doing to a poster someone drew?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.53,0:27:24.74,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We were only committing fair warning on illegal posters!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.12,0:27:27.16,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Warning? Fair?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.16,0:27:28.12,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Don't give me that shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.12,0:27:29.50,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You guys are the illegal ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.75,0:27:32.21,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,How are we illegal?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.46,0:27:33.67,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.92,0:27:34.92,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,And this!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.92,0:27:36.55,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,And this, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.97,0:27:42.09,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.18,0:27:45.35,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,What are you all doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.68,0:27:48.14,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,The lunch break is already over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.39,0:27:50.44,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Go back to your classes already.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.31,0:27:54.15,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Keep your hands off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.50,0:28:17.63,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Everyone, leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.96,0:28:19.71,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Don't be late for your classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.71,0:28:21.51,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.68,0:28:28.89,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,I don't know what the cause was,\Nbut you have to talk first, Sunohara-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.89,0:28:30.02,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.93,0:28:32.39,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Return to your class now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.94,0:28:34.06,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.27,0:28:37.61,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That was a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.94,0:28:42.03,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I heard there was teacher who practices aikido and teaches second year classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.03,0:28:44.03,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It has to be her. What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.41,0:28:46.57,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,If I'm right, her name was...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.08,0:28:48.08,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Ibuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.08,0:28:49.49,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Ibuki Kouko!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.37,0:28:54.00,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Cool girls like her are right in my strike zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.33,0:28:56.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You perv.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.93,0:29:10.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How many did you draw in total?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.93,0:29:14.77,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Fourteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.23,0:29:19.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see. Some of them either got\Nthrown away or taken away by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.53,0:29:24.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I collected all the ones that I could find.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.11,0:29:27.70,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What a horrible thing they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.24,0:29:29.49,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.45,0:29:31.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"All right"?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.12,0:29:33.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Furukawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.37,0:29:36.87,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm all right. I'll draw them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.87,0:29:39.04,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll draw them again and post them everywhere on campus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.42,0:29:41.50,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You can't. They'll get you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.88,0:29:44.97,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,They put the cross and the void sign again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.26,0:29:50.18,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But I already made up my mind that I'll reestablish the Theater Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.56,0:29:53.64,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I never knew there was a deadline on the recruiting period.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.23,0:29:59.36,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Three! If there are three members, it gets acknowledged as a club.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.36,0:30:00.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Furukawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.65,0:30:02.73,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll draw the posters!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.73,0:30:06.32,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sure there are people who want to join the Theater Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.32,0:30:07.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,There have to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.74,0:30:10.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Furukawa, why do you want to do theater so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.16,0:30:14.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.75,0:30:19.46,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I can't tell you the reason now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.08,0:30:20.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.92,0:30:23.09,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But I want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.34,0:30:27.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay, then go draw the poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.26,0:30:33.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,A really amazing one, but just one will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.18,0:30:34.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We'll photocopy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.64,0:30:37.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We'll make a hundred or two hundred copies of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.39,0:30:39.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then Sunohara and I will post them all around the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.15,0:30:42.36,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Photocopy...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.61,0:30:45.15,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That's it, Okazaki! That's the way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.57,0:30:49.24,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,All right, leave it to us. If they're just copies, no matter how many crosses they make,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.45,0:30:51.74,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,we'll just post up more from over them!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.16,0:30:55.20,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This is a war!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.20,0:30:58.04,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'll take this to the extreme against the student council executives!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.58,0:31:04.38,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,War, eh? That's not very peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.42,0:31:10.18,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Sensei, here she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.68,0:31:19.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.23,0:31:23.82,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,This Furukawa-san is you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.52,0:31:25.82,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Ibuki-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.15,0:31:28.40,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Furukawa, you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.99,0:31:33.37,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,She was the advisor of the\NTheater Club before it closed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.37,0:31:35.33,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.96,0:31:41.67,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Furukawa-san, you're interested in theater?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.21,0:31:46.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. I filled out the member form once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.63,0:31:47.88,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Oh, you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.84,0:31:53.89,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But I couldn't come to school soon after\Nand had to be absent from school for the entire year,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.35,0:31:56.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,and the club was closed down while I was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.64,0:31:59.31,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.27,0:32:00.94,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.85,0:32:04.02,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Then, if the club is reestablished...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.61,0:32:06.02,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'd be very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.19,0:32:12.57,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,It is past the deadline, but if you can get members together, I'll talk to the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.57,0:32:14.32,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.74,0:32:16.37,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,So keep at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.45,0:32:18.29,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.06,0:32:41.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The plan ended in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.73,0:32:47.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No one wanted to join.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.69,0:32:49.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The reestablishment of the\NTheater Club was going to end in vain...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.98,0:32:50.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...or was supposed to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.40,0:32:53.15,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do, Furukawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.95,0:32:56.16,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This world favors comedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.16,0:32:58.16,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Serious stuff don't get much attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.04,0:33:02.12,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,We did what we can, so we have to face the results, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.50,0:33:03.92,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Right, Okazaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.92,0:33:05.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.92,0:33:10.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The poster was good, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.84,0:33:13.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa kept working.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.30,0:33:16.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She used an amazing secret trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.72,0:33:17.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She worked really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.72,0:33:23.27,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Wh-Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.27,0:33:25.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,H-Hold on a minute, Furukawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.61,0:33:30.52,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll have you two fill out the member form.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.78,0:33:34.45,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Then that makes three including me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.45,0:33:35.36,Default,2,0,0,0,,Furukawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.03,0:33:38.12,Default,2,0,0,0,,Then everything will be solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.49,0:33:43.58,Default,2,0,0,0,,The Theater Club will have Ibuki-sensei as the advisor and will restart.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.08,0:33:47.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry Furukawa. I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.83,0:33:50.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm not going to participate in a club.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.13,0:33:53.46,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yeah. We're staying away from clubs!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.01,0:33:57.89,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Both Okazaki and I are able to be who we are because we aren't in any clubs!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.34,0:34:01.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm not into acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.51,0:34:02.77,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Like water and oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.77,0:34:04.18,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,He's a basketball man,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.18,0:34:06.77,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,and I was once called the soccer prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.77,0:34:09.06,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yes, I know, it's about the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.73,0:34:13.99,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,In other words, screaming "You idiot" at the sunset,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.90,0:34:17.86,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,or saying "I love you. J-J-Ju-Ju..."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.86,0:34:22.03,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,for a love scene are total mismatches for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.03,0:34:23.83,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,We don't comprehend that kind of language!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.66,0:34:25.79,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Are you fine with this argument?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.79,0:34:26.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.25,0:34:29.13,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Do you understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.60,0:34:43.47,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Stop giggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.97,0:34:48.31,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please don’t worry too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.02,0:34:49.60,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.60,0:34:51.90,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Fine? What about?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.90,0:34:57.36,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I plan on doing a solo play on the Founders Festival's stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.36,0:34:59.53,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Solo play?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.53,0:35:05.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I won't ask either of you to stand on the stage or recite lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.62,0:35:09.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I promise-
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.92,0:35:10.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.17,0:35:13.38,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.79,0:35:20.18,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um... Um... That's Dangos on a Stick from the Big Dango Family series, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.18,0:35:22.64,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Yes. You know your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.64,0:35:23.64,Default,Man,0,0,0,,You're exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.64,0:35:26.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I've been searching for it. I'll have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.93,0:35:31.85,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Oh, but I don't have money on me, so may I come get it tomorrow after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.85,0:35:33.27,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Sure, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.27,0:35:36.03,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That's great. I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.03,0:35:39.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please don't sell it until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.78,0:35:44.08,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Don't worry. The boom was long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.08,0:35:46.37,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Nobody wants it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.37,0:35:50.75,Default,Man,0,0,0,,You can take it with you today. Come pay me tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.50,0:35:52.79,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.79,0:35:54.21,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.21,0:35:58.46,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dango, dango, dango, dango.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.46,0:36:02.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dango family is a big family.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.68,0:36:08.85,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Always a happy big family.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.68,0:36:05.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That was the extent of our resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.39,0:36:10.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We were signed up to the club, going with the flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.48,0:36:13.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,With the flow...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.69,0:36:18.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I guess that was very much alike me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.20,0:36:25.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And, like always, after I get carried with the flow,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.49,0:36:28.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll regret it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.04,0:36:33.12,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,A solo play.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.00,0:36:36.38,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,That sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.17,0:36:43.76,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,It's very suitable for this small Theater Club that has just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.76,0:36:46.97,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,"Small", eh? She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.97,0:36:48.68,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,So small.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.68,0:36:51.02,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,What will the scenario be?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.02,0:36:53.60,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, I'll work on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.36,0:36:57.52,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,What play are you going to perform?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.52,0:36:59.02,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,On what play will you base it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.44,0:37:03.15,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,There are many to choose from, like Shakespeare or Baudelaire's poems.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.15,0:37:06.12,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No, um... It'll be an original work.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.74,0:37:07.95,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Original?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.95,0:37:09.33,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.16,0:37:11.16,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.16,0:37:13.96,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,I see. I can't wait to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.71,0:37:15.33,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.25,0:37:20.59,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,We're less than a month before the\NFounders Festival, so you have much to work on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.05,0:37:21.80,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.30,0:37:24.88,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,I'll help you out anytime you need assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.43,0:37:26.26,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.64,0:37:29.68,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Okay then, stage crew boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.81,0:37:37.61,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,This room will be the club room starting today,\Nso sort out the necessary and unnecessary things.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.57,0:37:41.44,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Where's your answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.03,0:37:43.40,Default,2,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.65,0:37:47.28,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,That concludes the first new Theater Club's meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.74,0:37:49.74,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Good luck everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.08,0:37:52.33,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,She said we're the stage crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.66,0:37:54.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Looks like we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.00,0:38:00.38,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I had a brighter image of a Theater Club, but I guess shadows exist everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.75,0:38:02.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Can't agree more.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.51,0:38:04.47,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll help out as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.14,0:38:09.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Your house?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.85,0:38:11.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.47,0:38:13.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Your house, eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.93,0:38:15.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes, my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.02,0:38:17.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.27,0:38:20.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm saying, please join me for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.81,0:38:22.19,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Then we'll have a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.73,0:38:23.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.98,0:38:24.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.19,0:38:32.33,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I need to write the script, and I'm sure you two need to work out your schedules with this new commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.33,0:38:34.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who cares about working out schedules?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.16,0:38:35.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.58,0:38:39.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about scenario and stuff, and I'm not interested in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.29,0:38:40.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But dinner...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.33,0:38:43.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can't go to other people's house just to go eat dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.09,0:38:45.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Convenience store food matches my stomach best.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.71,0:38:46.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Right, Sunohara?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.63,0:38:48.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, Sunohara!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.63,0:38:51.22,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have something to take care of today!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.06,0:38:54.43,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.43,0:38:58.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Stop, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.69,0:39:01.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You plan on leaving me at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.98,0:39:03.57,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,No, I seriously have business to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.90,0:39:05.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Stop screwing around with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.78,0:39:06.65,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I have a part-time job.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.40,0:39:08.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Part-time job?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.74,0:39:15.16,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I heard my house's doing horrible financially.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.16,0:39:17.50,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,My monthly allowance hasn't been sent to me in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.87,0:39:22.46,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I know what it's like right now,\Nbut I've decided to pick up a job. Three times a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.13,0:39:27.42,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,A senpai... A senpai from our school hooked me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.09,0:39:29.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.18,0:39:33.18,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Today's the first day. I don't want to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.18,0:39:33.93,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.51,0:39:35.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sunohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.18,0:39:39.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry I stopped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.23,0:39:41.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.04,0:39:59.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Your house is a bakery?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.16,0:40:03.29,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Furukawa Bread is famous around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.21,0:40:06.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.13,0:40:10.80,Default,San,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.30,0:40:12.64,Default,San,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.64,0:40:15.10,Default,San,0,0,0,,Oh? I had heard you were bringing two guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.10,0:40:16.01,Default,San,0,0,0,,There's only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.01,0:40:19.52,Default,San,0,0,0,,I get it! He must be Okazaki Tomoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.52,0:40:21.06,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You guessed right, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.60,0:40:25.23,Default,San,0,0,0,,Of course I can tell; he's exactly as you described.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.65,0:40:28.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How did she describe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.98,0:40:32.11,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Shh. You can't, Mom. We promised you wouldn't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.49,0:40:34.70,Default,San,0,0,0,,Therefore, I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.41,0:40:36.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Where's Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.78,0:40:37.79,Default,San,0,0,0,,Over at the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.79,0:40:41.00,Default,San,0,0,0,,Playing baseball with the children\Nfrom the neighborhood like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.00,0:40:42.25,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Ah, baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.25,0:40:43.75,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes, baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.75,0:40:49.05,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You must be Okazaki Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.05,0:40:52.22,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You've been sucking up to Nagisa and finally made your way into our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.51,0:40:54.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, um... I never...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.22,0:40:56.93,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,If you're a man, then fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.93,0:40:57.89,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Come to the park!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.43,0:40:59.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.68,0:41:02.14,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.77,0:41:04.77,Default,San,0,0,0,,Dinner will be ready soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.35,0:41:07.23,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.90,0:41:14.86,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Okazaki?!\NCatch it with everything you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.49,0:41:16.53,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Life is...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.07,0:41:18.70,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,...about fights!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.70,0:41:20.79,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,The moment you let down your guard...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.79,0:41:25.21,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,...you get stamped as a loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.17,0:41:33.26,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.97,0:41:35.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I've never played baseball before.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.39,0:41:37.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in it, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.60,0:41:41.97,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Just throw the ball back already.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.89,0:41:47.65,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,If I catch the ball you throw,\NI can judge how big a man you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.65,0:41:49.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"How big"?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.98,0:41:52.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Big as in how?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.24,0:41:56.95,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,A, B+, or C-.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.95,0:42:00.03,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'm judging if you're suitable for Nagisa or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.03,0:42:02.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't want you making judgments on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.04,0:42:05.75,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't get out of the way this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.96,0:42:14.13,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Good! Now throw it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.90,0:42:32.65,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Why don't you throw it back properly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.65,0:42:35.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The tendon in my shoulder's torn,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.94,0:42:38.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,so my right arm can only go up this high.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.62,0:42:47.83,Default,San,0,0,0,,Akio-san! Dinner's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.83,0:42:49.37,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.75,0:42:52.84,Default,San,0,0,0,,Akio-san, has the shirataki absorbed enough flavor?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.09,0:42:55.71,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Yes, it's the best. Sanae-chan's the best cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.71,0:42:57.09,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You are the iron chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.09,0:42:58.55,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,A hottie on top of that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.01,0:43:00.93,Default,San,0,0,0,,Akio-san, you have rice on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.34,0:43:02.35,Default-alt,Aki,0,0,0,,Take it off for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.47,0:43:05.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, it's almost strange how well your parents get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.06,0:43:04.31,Default-alt,San,0,0,0,,They're off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.31,0:43:05.72,Default-alt,Aki,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.23,0:43:07.73,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,They're always like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.10,0:43:08.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Always?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.27,0:43:11.69,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Here, Sanae-chan. Say "Ah".
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.69,0:43:12.65,Default,San,0,0,0,,Ah~
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.77,0:43:16.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's not "almost". They are strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.19,0:43:19.32,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-san. Say "Ah".
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.32,0:43:20.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.45,0:43:22.45,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,How about some, Okazaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.03,0:43:23.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.24,0:43:27.41,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You're still in high school, remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.41,0:43:30.96,Default,San,0,0,0,,Akio-san, you're so mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.50,0:43:34.38,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But, Sanae-chan loves Akio-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.38,0:43:36.42,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.80,0:43:38.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can't take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.88,0:43:40.63,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey, grumpy face.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.47,0:43:42.80,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.39,0:43:44.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't mind me if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.43,0:43:48.14,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,He fell for it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.77,0:43:51.94,Default,San,0,0,0,,Oh, Akio-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.48,0:44:00.03,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Aw, that felt good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.41,0:44:06.24,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey, you two go take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.91,0:44:14.21,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Of course I was joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.13,0:44:16.67,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Scenario?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.09,0:44:19.05,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes, scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.30,0:44:23.47,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,But I don't hear a thing coming from Nagisa's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.47,0:44:26.26,Default,San,0,0,0,,Of course, since she's working on the scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.93,0:44:33.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What kind of plot is this original story going to have?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.11,0:44:38.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, what was that, Tomoya-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.48,0:44:41.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nothing. Go ahead and keep working. Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.78,0:44:44.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okay. Then I'll continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.87,0:44:51.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You own a lot of the Big Dango Family, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.96,0:44:54.50,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Actually, there is more than this out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.13,0:44:57.09,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I will collect them all one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.71,0:45:00.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.76,0:45:02.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll should get myself out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.22,0:45:06.43,Default,San,0,0,0,,This is one of Akio-san's old pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.43,0:45:07.30,Default,San,0,0,0,,Go ahead and use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.97,0:45:10.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh no. I'm leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.72,0:45:13.56,Default,San,0,0,0,,Oh, you weren't planning on staying over?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.81,0:45:17.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I never intended to.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.31,0:45:19.40,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Just stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.78,0:45:20.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.73,0:45:26.03,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,As a fellow Theater Club member, you plan on leaving Nagisa, who might end up pulling an all-nighter, alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.03,0:45:26.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.74,0:45:29.16,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Then stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.74,0:45:30.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.00,0:45:34.62,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't worry; you'll be sharing a bed with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.62,0:45:35.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.25,0:45:36.33,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You got problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.33,0:45:37.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.21,0:45:39.59,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Want me to lock you in a figure-four? {figure-four leglock; submission move}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.11,0:46:06.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You can't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.32,0:46:08.28,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No. You can't either?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.53,0:46:11.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,My reason is obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.62,0:46:14.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm basically sleeping with a wild animal in the same cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.54,0:46:17.54,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dad's snoring must be keeping you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.54,0:46:19.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.88,0:46:22.67,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I heard Mom got used to it soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.80,0:46:26.51,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,If you listen to it closely, she says it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.47,0:46:31.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What does it take to hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.51,0:46:35.56,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You smiled. Tomoya-san smiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.56,0:46:36.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.85,0:46:40.77,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-san, who always has a grumpy face, smiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.77,0:46:41.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.82,0:46:45.69,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You have a very kind face when you smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.36,0:46:48.74,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.91,0:46:58.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I know what I should write.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.00,0:47:02.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But I can't write it well, so I can't go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.34,0:47:05.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Also, I'm happy to have you close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.88,0:47:11.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm so happy, so it feels like a waste to go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.18,0:47:16.22,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.10,0:47:22.06,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Dream... It's about a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.27,0:47:27.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's about the dream that I've been having since I was little and am still having.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.90,0:47:29.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That's what I want to write about.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.61,0:47:32.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What kind of dream is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.49,0:47:34.99,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll share it with you once the scenario is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.49,0:47:36.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.54,0:47:42.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You know, I also have a dream that I've been having since I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.92,0:47:44.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,How does it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.25,0:47:47.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mine's a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.59,0:47:50.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I always wake up in a cold sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.88,0:47:51.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't even want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.04,0:48:17.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Furukawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.45,0:48:20.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.91,0:48:24.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Today was the first time in a while I ate a meal with so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.38,0:48:25.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It was really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.13,0:48:29.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was very warm, and it made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.55,0:48:37.56,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm glad. I'm happy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.28,0:48:53.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Soon after that day, I saw the dream starting from where I'd left off last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.54,0:49:07.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But this time, the dream didn't end with the repetition of hopeless situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.80,0:49:13.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It had a turn where I could almost catch a glimmer of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.64,0:49:22.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Words echoed in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.19,0:49:26.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"The Tree of Promise."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.61,0:49:32.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"At the end of this wilderness, there is the Tree of Promise."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.90,0:49:34.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"It awaits you."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.99,0:49:37.24,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Tree of Promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.66,0:49:38.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Waiting for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.49,0:49:40.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.79,0:49:41.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who is?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.71,0:49:48.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It was clear to me what was waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.63,0:49:54.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It must the "someone" that I'd been searching for.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.18,0:50:01.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Something burned inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.14,0:50:04.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Something sparked inside my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.94,0:50:08.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I ran with everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.94,0:50:11.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Aiming for the end of the wilderness...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.03,0:50:13.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Aiming for the end of the life...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.20,0:50:22.16,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.29,0:50:25.25,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.71,0:50:27.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sunohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.34,0:50:33.30,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,He's my senpai, Yoshino. Yoshino Yusuke-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.67,0:50:35.88,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This is Okazaki. Former basketball player.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.22,0:50:37.84,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Currently a Theater Club member.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.84,0:50:39.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Quit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.85,0:50:45.48,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,We're short on people. Do you want a part-time job, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.48,0:50:46.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.89,0:50:48.40,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Give it some thought, Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.40,0:50:49.90,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,The pay is pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.90,0:50:51.19,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,We're going to the next site.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.61,0:50:52.52,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.61,0:50:55.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What time are you getting out, Sunohara?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.83,0:51:12.84,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yoshino-san used to be a famous musician in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.46,0:51:14.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Musician?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.46,0:51:20.05,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,He was in a rock band and released a lot of CDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.47,0:51:24.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,But for some reason, he dropped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.68,0:51:27.85,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Right now, he's come back to this city and is working like any other person.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.10,0:51:35.11,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Doesn't that sound like how we\Ngave up on soccer and basketball?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.48,0:51:37.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, it's completely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.36,0:51:39.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He went all the way to standing under the spotlight once.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.28,0:51:42.12,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.62,0:51:54.50,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Nagisa. Okazaki What's-His-Name won't be coming tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.42,0:51:57.88,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.88,0:52:00.38,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.51,0:52:04.89,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I can't make it to the Founders Festival's preparations at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.56,0:52:08.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm in charge of Sound and you're Lighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.48,0:52:11.52,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.56,0:52:15.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ibuki-sensei made the decision today.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.48,0:52:17.19,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.57,0:52:20.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But Furukawa's scenario is behind schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.07,0:52:26.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She might have to wing it on stage that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.25,0:52:33.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Furukawa has it rough, but we might need to be ready for this thing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.96,0:52:36.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Go and see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.54,0:52:38.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's more fitting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.96,0:52:40.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Less things to worry about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.26,0:52:43.18,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Are you serious about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.94,0:52:56.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The day of the Founders Festival came.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.12,0:53:11.54,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,What? You can't do that to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.54,0:53:13.54,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Why are you teaching math in English class?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.92,0:53:17.50,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Ah god. This is what I always get from silly students.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.92,0:53:21.21,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Listen. Mathank you very much. {Math - thank? ugh...}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.76,0:53:25.76,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Thank you for you time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.27,0:53:40.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're joking, right, Furukawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.44,0:53:43.78,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, can you repeat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.07,0:53:46.24,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Furukawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.41,0:53:48.74,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.49,0:53:54.41,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I couldn't get the scenario done in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.10,0:54:17.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This is so like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.35,0:54:24.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The first New Theater Club's performance gets canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.53,0:54:31.28,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.08,0:54:34.83,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I couldn't get the scenario done in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.46,0:54:39.04,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,but I plan on standing on the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.04,0:54:42.34,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Furukawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.96,0:54:47.59,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's complete inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.60,0:54:58.81,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,B-But, Furukawa. We need to read the scenario at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.98,0:55:00.81,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Like for Lighting and Sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.23,0:55:03.73,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Or else we won't have a clue what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.11,0:55:06.24,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.57,0:55:09.53,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,I'll give orders as I watch the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.20,0:55:11.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.95,0:55:16.25,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Let's all trust the scenario Furukawa-san has in her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.75,0:55:21.71,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's a very wonderful story.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.26,0:55:35.27,Default,San,0,0,0,,Akio-san, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.02,0:55:43.27,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Let's see. Where is the auditorium Nagisa will be performing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.15,0:55:46.69,Default,San,0,0,0,,Looks like Nagisa won't be on stage until much later.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.15,0:55:49.24,Default,San,0,0,0,,Let's have lunch in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.86,0:55:51.16,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Yeah. That sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.88,0:56:07.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.26,0:56:09.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I knew I'd find you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.05,0:56:14.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Have you had lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.97,0:56:17.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You won't be up until around evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.77,0:56:19.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You won't last unless you eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.65,0:56:27.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We heard there's a cheap but good udon stand,\Nand Sunohara went dashing to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.78,0:56:32.70,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I don't think my stomach will accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.41,0:56:34.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Not much you can do about it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.24,0:56:36.45,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.70,0:56:43.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for causing trouble for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.42,0:56:46.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Stop apologizing!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.54,0:56:47.46,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.75,0:56:51.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You will stand on the stage and do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.47,0:56:52.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We'll follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.97,0:56:54.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's what we decided on doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.93,0:56:58.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Have confidence and do it with pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.39,0:57:03.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Like Ibuki-sensei said, there's nothing more we can do than trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.35,0:57:05.06,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.36,0:57:07.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah! That's what I want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.15,0:57:08.02,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.78,0:57:09.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.94,0:57:10.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.49,0:57:14.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.45,0:57:17.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Make sure you read over the scenario in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.16,0:57:19.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.29,0:57:23.46,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I think I'm suddenly hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.96,0:57:25.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.75,0:57:27.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're so unmanageable.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.42,0:57:29.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Fine, wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.17,0:57:31.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll get you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.39,0:57:48.15,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Let me share the reason why I want to do theater so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.48,0:57:56.95,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,My dad and mom used to work together as actors in a theatrical group.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.62,0:58:02.91,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But after getting married and having me, they gave up on staying actors.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.50,0:58:08.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I was physically weak when I was a child, so they chose to be with me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.30,0:58:17.30,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That's why they quit the theater group,\Nmoved to this city, and started a bakery.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.84,0:58:22.10,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,They figured a homemade bakery would let the family always be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.02,0:58:32.23,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,So... So standing on the stage is a way of thanking my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.73,0:58:35.28,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Showing how well I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.78,0:58:40.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That I still remember what their dreams were.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.96,0:58:50.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Something like that happens in this world, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.34,0:58:55.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,To pick family over your own dreams...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.13,0:58:58.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So you can find something like this if you look for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.01,0:59:04.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It sounds like a story totally unrelated to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.78,0:59:22.33,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,What the hell are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.33,0:59:25.79,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,When you get that attitude,\Nyou're supposed to slap them around.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.79,0:59:27.12,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.91,0:59:28.96,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Where's my glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.34,0:59:36.51,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Did you bring a costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.71,0:59:39.47,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. I borrowed it from my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.13,0:59:42.43,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Let's go. It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.85,0:59:43.51,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.32,1:00:00.99,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.28,1:00:02.70,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Ah, Yoshino-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.95,1:00:06.99,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were coming to the Founders Festival.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.37,1:00:11.67,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,When you're done, I'll be waiting at the usual place.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.58,1:00:13.33,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.63,1:00:18.38,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Well, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.51,1:00:20.55,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Yup. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.68,1:00:29.27,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Sensei, you were dating Yoshino-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.27,1:00:31.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I never knew that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.35,1:00:32.52,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,You just dropped something.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.94,1:00:36.57,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Where? Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.57,1:00:37.32,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Where?!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.20,1:00:46.37,Default,PA,0,0,0,,Next is a solo play by the Theater Club.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.74,1:00:48.83,Default,PA,0,0,0,,The Empty World.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.50,1:01:00.01,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Lighting, stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.42,1:01:06.10,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,First, flow Furukawa-san with the spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.05,1:01:07.72,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.68,1:01:10.06,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Sound, ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.60,1:01:11.27,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Counting down, ten seconds...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.52,1:01:14.40,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Five seconds...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.65,1:01:18.02,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Slowly come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.86,1:01:19.48,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Two...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.07,1:01:20.86,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,One...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.28,1:01:21.90,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.20,1:01:32.66,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Sanae... That's...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.33,1:01:36.79,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes. It's the dress I wore at our wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.79,1:01:38.13,Default,San,0,0,0,,I gave it to Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.59,1:01:39.75,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Gave it to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.13,1:01:44.05,Default,San,0,0,0,,Yes. Since I won't have the chance to wear it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.14,1:01:47.89,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Well, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.68,1:01:52.35,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The empty world...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.85,1:01:54.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What's there is wind...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.77,1:01:57.23,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,...a small ray of light...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.73,1:01:59.36,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,...occasional snow...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.44,1:02:05.74,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,...and me, who is so tired that there isn't even a tear to shed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.36,1:02:08.24,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Drop down the music a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.82,1:02:12.20,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Sound of wind in the back. Louder slowly.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.67,1:02:19.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,How much time has passed?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.00,1:02:21.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,One month?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.46,1:02:22.67,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Two months?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.38,1:02:26.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Five years may have passed for all I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.64,1:02:36.31,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,These days, I can't even recall what I was waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.35,1:02:38.90,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Change lighting to blue.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.86,1:02:40.98,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Give it a soft feel to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.07,1:02:44.11,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Yes, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.70,1:02:52.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But the wind that comes from the ocean...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.99,1:02:55.71,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,The familiar, warm wind.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.12,1:03:00.71,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Like the warmth of a mother's hand or a father's kindness.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.67,1:03:07.63,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,When that wind covers my body, I will regain my memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.26,1:03:11.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I will become a little better and come alive once more.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.10,1:03:14.81,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Overlap the sounds of wind and waves.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.18,1:03:17.27,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Increase the volume of BGM a little over time.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.27,1:03:18.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.02,1:03:21.40,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What I'm waiting for is...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.98,1:03:24.36,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's your voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.11,1:03:28.32,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's a very small, hesitant voice,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.65,1:03:33.74,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,but it's your beautiful voice\Nthat represents your kind heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.45,1:03:38.62,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Your voice soaks into my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.29,1:03:41.83,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Your voice and you...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.21,1:03:44.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,...are what I'm waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.80,1:03:46.84,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Start Music 2.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.17,1:03:48.67,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Slowly fade Music 1 out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.92,1:03:51.18,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Sunohara-kun, chase Furukawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.49,1:04:09.40,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I run.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.90,1:04:13.16,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I run for the end to the empty world.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.42,1:04:25.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I heard a voice inside my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.25,1:04:29.80,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,"Go to the end of the empty world."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.09,1:04:32.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,"Someone awaits you there."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.47,1:04:37.64,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,"For many, many years, that someone has been waiting for you."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.60,1:04:41.77,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,"Just as you were waiting."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.32,1:04:50.90,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,And in the end, this is what the voice said.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.32,1:04:54.82,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Okazaki-kun. Continue the music.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.83,1:04:56.78,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Okazaki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.33,1:05:01.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,"When you reach the end of the world, you shall witness..."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.25,1:05:06.96,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,"...the figure filled with life and shimmering gloriously!"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.92,1:05:11.51,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,"That is the Tree of Promise."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.22,1:05:13.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.51,1:05:15.39,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Okazaki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.64,1:05:20.35,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,"Someone is waiting for you under that tree!"
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.52,1:05:33.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Your solo play continued.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.87,1:05:39.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There were many things in the way,\Nbut you made it to the Tree of Promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.87,1:05:46.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I couldn't get any of the rest of the story into my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.92,1:05:57.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was shocked by the fact that for the longest time, you and I had been having the same dream, and I panicked.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.89,1:06:08.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I panicked because I always thought I was the only one who dreamed of anything as lonely as this empty world.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.94,1:06:13.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Furukawa... I never knew you shared the dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.82,1:06:18.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You always smiled so kindly\Nand always acted so cheerfully.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.28,1:06:22.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You would just laugh when you were in trouble, and yet you were...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.17,1:06:32.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.88,1:06:35.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,you are so dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.72,1:06:39.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's what I felt from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.90,1:06:51.02,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.65,1:06:53.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.98,1:06:54.94,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.58,1:07:08.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,After that, two springs went by.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.50,1:07:12.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's because soon after the Founders Festival,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.59,1:07:16.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa's health went downhill and she had to be away from school for nearly a year.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.59,1:07:26.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,In other words, Nagisa graduated from high school a year after us.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.98,1:07:29.69,Default,All,0,0,0,,Nagisa, congratulations on your graduation!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.40,1:07:37.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,After her graduation, when the sakura were in full bloom, we started living together...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.37,1:07:45.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...in this apartment.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.50,1:07:55.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.05,1:08:00.09,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.09,1:08:01.14,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,You're back late.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.01,1:08:03.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sakagami.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.97,1:08:07.77,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I stopped by Furukawa Bread today,\Nand they asked me to bring this to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.15,1:08:14.32,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Sanae-san said she wanted you to eat these.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.44,1:08:19.78,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,You aren't eating properly, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.49,1:08:26.70,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I thought bread alone wouldn't be enough, so I'm thinking of making some soup.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.12,1:08:28.45,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Let me borrow your kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.83,1:08:35.00,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I heard you don't go to Furukawa Bread too often.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.67,1:08:39.09,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Ushio-chan's become pretty big.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.89,1:08:44.80,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.81,1:08:48.22,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.22,1:08:49.85,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,What? Sunohara?!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.06,1:08:55.11,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Oh, Sakagami. You're here, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.11,1:08:57.23,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Wow, you're here from Tokyo?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.23,1:08:58.44,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Today's a weekday.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.44,1:08:59.49,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Do you have a day off?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.28,1:09:03.07,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Big companies have a thing called paid vacation.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.07,1:09:07.20,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Came on a bullet train and got on a local train. A long tiring trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.66,1:09:13.42,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey, former Theater Club.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.42,1:09:14.71,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Are you doing well?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.71,1:09:20.67,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,If you were, I wouldn't have come.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.67,1:09:21.51,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.01,1:09:29.06,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You're so hopeless; still depressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.06,1:09:30.81,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I heard you haven't been going to work at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.14,1:09:33.89,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Will you join us for dinner, Sunohara?\NYou haven't eaten yet, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.31,1:09:37.11,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll dig in. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.69,1:09:39.86,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Okazaki, come over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.36,1:09:41.69,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Let's all eat together.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.95,1:09:46.82,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Let's go, Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.82,1:09:47.57,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.12,1:09:56.79,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute. Today's the 24th, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.29,1:10:01.76,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's the monthly anniversary of her death, so let me offer some incense.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.67,1:10:04.01,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.15,1:10:23.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.82,1:10:25.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Our life in the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.07,1:10:29.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It really was for a short time, but it was fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.83,1:10:33.41,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.41,1:10:34.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.62,1:10:42.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I got employed full-time at the part-time position Yoshino-senpai first introduced me to after graduating.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.63,1:10:45.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa worked, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.59,1:10:48.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Four days a week at a nearby family restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.72,1:10:50.93,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Can I have some water?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.18,1:10:53.93,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sir, this is your fifth cup.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.93,1:10:56.56,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's fine, since I love water.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.98,1:10:58.65,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.90,1:11:10.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I often went to the shop with Sunohara, who hadn't left for Tokyo yet, and caused a lot of trouble for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.08,1:11:14.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We were actually visiting to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.04,1:11:19.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,To see you working hard with a smile.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.75,1:11:21.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We wanted to see you shine.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.29,1:11:25.80,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Hello. Welcome to Earnest Host.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.84,1:11:34.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Also, that small apartment really became like a house for the Big Dango Family.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.43,1:11:37.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Everyone would come visit us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.60,1:11:38.94,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Akio's here!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.94,1:11:40.15,Default,San,0,0,0,,Sanae's here!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.69,1:11:43.48,Default,San,0,0,0,,The two of us make Akio-Sanae.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.94,1:11:47.57,Default,San,0,0,0,,Sensei, why are you teaching math in English class?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.86,1:11:52.07,Default,San,0,0,0,,Oh dear... Silly bakers always ask me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.07,1:11:54.03,Default,San,0,0,0,,Listen this is the real,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.74,1:11:57.00,Default,San,0,0,0,,mathank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.00,1:12:00.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You stole that joke!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.21,1:12:02.88,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hello, Sunohara's here!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.29,1:12:04.84,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Sakagami Tomoyo's here!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.84,1:12:06.38,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Fujibayashi Kyou's here!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.76,1:12:10.38,Default,3,0,0,0,,Three of us make the Suno-Saka-Kyou Trio!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.88,1:12:12.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Our apartment isn't a comedy house!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.30,1:12:13.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.85,1:12:18.77,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Wow, looks like everyone's having fun here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.52,1:12:21.44,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,What's today's gathering about?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.44,1:12:24.19,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yoshino-senpai! Ibuki-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.15,1:12:28.15,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,We have the lovey-dovey couple!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.49,1:12:31.49,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I'm asking you what this gathering is about!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.49,1:12:33.99,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Nothing. We're just hanging out.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.49,1:12:35.87,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.12,1:12:36.79,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.87,1:12:41.42,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,All right then! Everyone, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.21,1:12:52.34,Default,All,0,0,0,,Dango, dango, dango, dango.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.34,1:12:56.35,Default,All,0,0,0,,Dango family is a big family.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.35,1:13:02.60,Default,All,0,0,0,,Always a happy big family.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.89,1:13:06.57,Default,All,0,0,0,,The house is always like a sports day.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.98,1:13:11.07,Default,All,0,0,0,,Ready go, run run run. Family marathon.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.19,1:13:09.53,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,I knew it wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.03,1:13:12.24,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Everyone gathered around you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.07,1:13:14.66,Default,All,0,0,0,,{\fscx104.296}Time for a bath. Get inside. Breath-holding competition.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.07,1:13:14.36,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.66,1:13:19.79,Default,All,0,0,0,,Dango. Dango's a big family.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.66,1:13:15.74,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Your cheerfulness.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.33,1:13:22.12,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Something about you that calmed everyone...\Nrecreated the Big Dango Family here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.67,1:13:28.05,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,But... But who thought you'd...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.05,1:13:32.42,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,See ya, Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.05,1:13:34.80,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'll go home today.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.80,1:13:37.93,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Do you like pasta? I'll make some next time I come.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.93,1:13:39.51,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,She means spaghetti.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.06,1:13:46.06,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.06,1:13:47.73,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.74,1:13:57.49,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What's gone wrong with Okazaki?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.08,1:14:00.29,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,He didn't say a single word to me in the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.79,1:14:01.91,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Sunohara.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.42,1:14:07.71,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,There's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.00,1:14:09.50,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,We have to let time take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.09,1:14:13.47,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm so pathetic to be unable to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.15,1:14:36.45,Default,Dr,0,0,0,,The baby seems to have\Na healthy heart. It's developing well.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.82,1:14:39.16,Default,Dr,0,0,0,,The problem lies with the mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.57,1:14:43.29,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Mother? So you mean with Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.79,1:14:46.92,Default,Dr,0,0,0,,She's been in and out of the hospital since she was young.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.71,1:14:52.05,Default,Dr,0,0,0,,Her body is weaker than you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.42,1:14:59.80,Default,Dr,0,0,0,,If she goes through labor and delivers the baby, the chances of her survival are very slim.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.80,1:15:02.39,Default,San,0,0,0,,Isn't there a way to save both of them?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.64,1:15:05.27,Default,Dr,0,0,0,,Please talk to your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.27,1:15:07.60,Default,Dr,0,0,0,,We'll do the best we can based on her answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.81,1:15:14.78,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We have to tell Nagisa everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.40,1:15:17.61,Default,San,0,0,0,,You think so, too, right, Tomoya-san?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.78,1:15:19.53,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.21,1:15:31.38,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I already named the baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.54,1:15:33.84,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.38,1:15:36.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.09,1:15:40.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Be it a boy or girl, it'll be Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.55,1:15:43.93,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Isn't it nice?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.72,1:15:45.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.89,1:15:47.60,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.60,1:15:50.35,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But Ushio exists closer to the center of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.98,1:15:55.82,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's very noble and moves gallantly through the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.07,1:16:02.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sure the baby won't be physically weak like me, and its heart will be much bigger and stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.41,1:16:04.49,Default,San,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.91,1:16:10.33,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm thinking nothing else other than delivering this baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.71,1:16:11.46,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.13,1:16:15.67,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want to meet this baby badly.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.67,1:16:17.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,So I'm sure I'll be fine, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.34,1:16:20.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I have to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.48,1:16:29.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.19,1:16:38.03,Default,Nurse,0,0,0,,Ushio-chan's born.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.57,1:16:39.61,Default,Nurse,0,0,0,,It's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.61,1:16:41.53,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,How's the mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.91,1:16:42.70,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,How's Nagisa doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.12,1:16:48.04,Default,Nurse,0,0,0,,The doctor said for the family to come immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.79,1:16:50.21,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Ushio...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.46,1:16:53.83,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Look at Ushio, Tomoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.25,1:16:55.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.75,1:17:00.34,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm glad I met Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.22,1:17:03.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm really happy...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.89,1:17:05.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.22,1:17:08.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you, too, Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.68,1:17:20.28,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That's right... I met you... under... many sakura...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.49,1:17:22.57,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.45,1:17:28.99,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,And then, we walked up the hill together.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.96,1:17:43.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,At the top of the hill is Dad holding Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.26,1:17:47.64,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mom's smiling...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.64,1:17:49.72,Default,San,0,0,0,,Nagisa! Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.72,1:17:52.60,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,...and everyone's there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.35,1:17:54.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't go Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.40,1:17:56.61,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm so happy...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.98,1:17:59.44,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Everyone's waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.98,1:18:03.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.03,1:18:04.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You don't have to walk up any hill!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.36,1:18:07.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You don't have to force yourself up!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.17,1:18:21.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.30,1:18:24.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Stay! Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.97,1:18:32.89,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,My beloved Tomoya-san...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.81,1:18:36.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.15,1:18:45.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.53,1:18:49.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.95,1:18:53.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa!!!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.35,1:19:16.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Soon after Nagisa died, I noticed something.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.23,1:19:32.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I noticed how I haven't had the nightmare I've been having since childhood for the longest time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.08,1:19:47.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think... after watching Nagisa's performance at the school's auditorium, I stopped having the nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.18,1:19:55.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But instead, ever since Nagisa died,\Na new nightmare started.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.89,1:20:02.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,To be precise, not a dream, but my life without Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.40,1:20:12.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This everyday life that I face as reality became like the empty world in the nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.58,1:20:17.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If it's a dream, I can wake up from it as morning comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.00,1:20:24.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But there is no morning to this empty world.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.96,1:20:33.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The world where Nagisa doesn't exist will continue endlessly.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.27,1:20:47.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What? What time do you think it is?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.82,1:20:53.24,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I'm off to the night shift, but I had to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.53,1:20:56.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There's nothing to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.41,1:21:00.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.50,1:21:03.21,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Let me make some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.55,1:21:10.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.42,1:21:16.81,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I heard you're leaving Ushio-chan with\Nher grandparents and you don't go see her at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.10,1:21:20.89,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I heard you haven't done much at all these past five years.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.81,1:21:23.65,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Not a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.73,1:21:28.53,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Yes, you're being just like me!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.74,1:21:34.95,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Just like how I wronged you after your mother died!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.37,1:21:41.16,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,When your mother died, everything went black to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.16,1:21:47.63,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,As a result, I made you feel lonely at the most crucial time in your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.42,1:21:52.63,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I couldn't pay attention to you at all,\Nand all I could do was bemoan my tragic life.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.42,1:21:58.26,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,By the time I noticed it, you had already gone far away.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.47,1:22:01.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just stay far way.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.81,1:22:04.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't come close to me, just like we haven't been.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.48,1:22:08.52,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I beg you. Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.15,1:22:10.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Quit it!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.57,1:22:12.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What kind of father kneels before his son?!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.70,1:22:17.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I didn't want to see you like that, so that's why I... I...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.08,1:22:25.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.46,1:22:26.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.63,1:22:29.54,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I've made you angry again.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.84,1:22:32.51,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.38,1:22:36.72,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.72,1:22:38.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.22,1:22:44.64,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Ah, well... The rain will continue for a while, so don't catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.73,1:22:47.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.31,1:22:49.40,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.03,1:23:03.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't give me this crap...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.41,1:23:07.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Stop acting like my father...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.05,1:23:17.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't give me this...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.76,1:23:19.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.27,1:23:33.07,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Okazaki! Are you home?!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.19,1:23:36.69,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.24,1:23:38.74,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,The rain's gone already.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.41,1:23:40.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.99,1:23:42.28,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Pack it up, Kouko.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.45,1:23:43.37,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Two shirts,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.83,1:23:45.08,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,four boxers,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.08,1:23:46.37,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,some socks,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.96,1:23:48.67,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,and one change of long pants.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.87,1:23:51.58,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll pick and choose some other stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.04,1:23:53.21,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Wash your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.21,1:23:54.05,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Brush your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.46,1:23:55.67,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Don't waste any time.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.76,1:23:58.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this about?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.76,1:24:00.01,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You're going on a trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.26,1:24:01.72,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I'll hear your complaints later.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.72,1:24:02.47,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Just do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.39,1:24:05.56,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Packed and ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.10,1:24:07.93,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,All right then, off you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.19,1:24:11.52,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Hop in.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.07,1:24:19.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Trip you said? Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.57,1:24:20.70,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Just a little somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.70,1:24:21.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.20,1:24:25.20,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Shut up. Keep your mouth shut and sit.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.20,1:24:25.95,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.75,1:24:32.13,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.71,1:24:35.17,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,All right, hop in.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.75,1:24:37.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sunohara?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.88,1:24:42.80,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Sunohara, were you able to book the tickets?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.26,1:24:44.22,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yes, Sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.22,1:24:46.01,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Got everyone's seats reserved.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.64,1:24:47.72,Default,2,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.93,1:24:49.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.44,1:24:52.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Reserved seats? Everyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.27,1:24:53.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What is this about?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.81,1:24:55.94,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Hey, over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.94,1:24:56.90,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.86,1:25:01.11,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,Come on, hop on in.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.11,1:25:02.11,Default,2,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.53,1:25:07.70,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,There's your bento.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.29,1:25:10.00,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Here's yours Sunohara.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.00,1:25:10.66,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Woohoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.29,1:25:14.42,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,We woke up early and made them together.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.29,1:25:16.42,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,This looks amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.42,1:25:17.46,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.00,1:25:19.88,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Eat up, Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.88,1:25:21.05,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,You haven't had breakfast, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.92,1:25:23.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What is this about?!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.35,1:25:28.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't understand, but you're all being too weird!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.27,1:25:34.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Senpai! What is this about?!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.73,1:25:35.81,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,A camp trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.86,1:25:37.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Camp?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.27,1:25:41.32,Default,Ibu,0,0,0,,That's right. It's the Big Dango Family camp trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.32,1:25:44.41,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,We reserved a lodge by a beach for a week.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.41,1:25:45.66,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,We're all going to have a camp there.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.57,1:25:47.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Big Dango Family...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.99,1:25:49.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Camp trip...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.58,1:25:52.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can't go along with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.75,1:25:55.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's not with us anymore...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.25,1:25:57.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa's gone!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.43,1:26:07.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.68,1:26:09.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll get off at the next station.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.60,1:26:11.97,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.64,1:26:14.89,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,We're taking you no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.44,1:26:22.03,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I was asked to about ten days ago by a certain person.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.36,1:26:25.20,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,So I will take you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.24,1:26:26.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,By who?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.41,1:26:28.95,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I can't tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.75,1:26:34.75,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Please. And I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.54,1:26:38.13,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Tomoya can't stand on his own yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.50,1:26:42.21,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Please save him with all of your support.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.09,1:26:44.09,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.26,1:26:49.85,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,He booked the lodge and put together today's plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.81,1:26:51.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who?!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.22,1:26:54.10,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,You'll figure it out one day.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.10,1:26:56.35,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Once you can stand on your own, you will.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.75,1:27:24.46,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Let's see. We're supposed to get picked up at the platform.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.09,1:27:27.68,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Hey, Sunohara. Go check the fifth platform.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.68,1:27:28.43,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.89,1:27:31.35,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Sakagami and Fujibayashi, go check the ticket counter.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.35,1:27:32.18,Default,2,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.68,1:27:35.14,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Okazaki, you go check the second platform.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.81,1:27:41.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Second...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.48,1:27:43.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Second platform...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.23,1:27:47.07,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Did Okazaki go?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.36,1:27:50.16,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Yeah. He just went on his way.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.30,1:28:49.30,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,This is Dango.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.30,1:28:50.68,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I'll give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.18,1:28:56.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.78,1:29:13.78,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Papa.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.12,1:29:17.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. Hello, Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.41,1:29:19.83,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.33,1:29:20.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.80,1:29:37.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It was only for a moment, but I saw\Nthe dream again from where I'd left off.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.72,1:29:43.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Under the Tree of Promise, was you, Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.94,1:29:45.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You stood there.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.31,1:29:47.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,With a smile...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.11,1:29:51.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,With your usual lovely smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.11,0:01:48.42,KaraRom_OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur2.4}{\k35}Su{\k20}ki {\k30}to{\k65}o{\k165}ru {\k30}yu{\k35}me {\k20}o {\k35}mi{\k20}te {\k35}i{\k175}ta {\k40}Ya{\k40}wa{\k40}ra{\k40}ka{\k110}i {\k35}e{\k30}i{\k40}e{\k190}n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.11,0:01:48.42,KaraEng_OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur2.4}I was having a transparent dream\NIt was a tender eternity
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:55.13,KaraRom_OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur2.4}{\k30}Ka{\k30}ze {\k20}no {\k65}yo{\k165}na {\k22}ka{\k53}su{\k25}ko {\k35}na {\k30}ko{\k20}e {\k80}ga
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:55.13,KaraEng_OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur2.4}The faint, wind-like voice
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.97,0:02:02.01,KaraRom_OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur2.4}{\k35}Ta{\k35}ka{\k25}i {\k55}so{\k65}ra {\k20}ka{\k58}ra {\k22}bo{\k60}ku {\k20}ho {\k45}yo{\k15}n{\k25}de {\k35}i{\k90}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.97,0:02:02.01,KaraEng_OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur2.4}Is calling me from the high sky\NIf I take off while like this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:15.44,KaraRom_OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur2.4}{\k100}Ko{\k45}no {\k85}ma{\k100}ma {\k105}to{\k40}bi {\k65}ta{\k20}te{\k65}ba {\k40}do{\k105}ko {\k20}ni {\k80}da{\k32}tte {\k22}yu{\k50}ke{\k310}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:15.44,KaraEng_OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur2.4}I can go anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.82,0:02:22.24,KaraRom_OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur2.4}{\k100}Ka{\k30}sa{\k20}ne{\k145}ta {\k20}te{\k125}to {\k20}te {\k20}no {\k85}na{\k20}ka{\k60}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.82,0:02:22.24,KaraEng_OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur2.4}If we can see a little future
